# Ainok Wayfarer ({1}{G}, 1/1): "When this creature enters, mill three cards. You may put a land card from among them into your
# hand. If you don't, put a +1/+1 counter on this creature." Bot1 takes the Island among the three milled (the Ornithopter is not offered): it is in hand, the other two stay in the graveyard, and the Wayfarer stays a 1/1.

[Bot1 Deck]
Mox Emerald
Mox Ruby
Ainok Wayfarer
Ornithopter x4
Island
Ornithopter
Memnite
Forest x10

[Bot2 Deck]
Island x20

[Actions]
Bot1.Hand.Mox Emerald.Cast
Bot1.Hand.Mox Ruby.Cast
Bot1.Battlefield.Mox Emerald.Activate
Bot1.Battlefield.Mox Ruby.Activate
Bot1.Hand.Ainok Wayfarer.Cast
Bot1.Pass
Bot2.Pass
! Bot1.Choose(Ornithopter)
Bot1.Choose(Island)

[Expect]
Bot1.Hand = Island; Ornithopter; Ornithopter; Ornithopter; Ornithopter
Bot1.Graveyard = Memnite; Ornithopter
Bot1.Battlefield.Ainok Wayfarer.Power = 1
